    "# Lecture 1: Introduction to Data Analysis & Linear Regression\n",
    "\n",
    "[![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/dorksquith/DataAnalysisTechniques/blob/main/lecture_1_template.ipynb)\n",
    "\n",
    "Welcome to your first interactive statistics lab! In this notebook, we combine our lecture concepts with live Python code execution.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Core Statistical Concepts (From Slides)\n",
    "* **Mean ($\mu$):** The mathematical average of a dataset.\n",
    "* **Standard Deviation ($\sigma$):** The measure of data dispersion.\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\sigma = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i - \\mu)^2}{N}}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Let's look at how we compute these metrics dynamically using Python's `pandas` and `numpy` libraries."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "# 1. Generate dummy student study hours vs exam scores\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "study_hours = np.random.uniform(2, 20, 50)\n",
    "exam_scores = 3.5 * study_hours + np.random.normal(0, 8, 50) + 30\n",
    "\n",
    "# Create a DataFrame\n",
    "df = pd.DataFrame({'Study_Hours': study_hours, 'Exam_Score': exam_scores})\n",
    "\n",
    "# Display summary descriptive statistics\n",
    "print("--- Dataset Summary Statistics ---")\n",
    "print(df.describe())\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Visualising the Relationship\n",
    "Below, we will write code to plot a scatter plot of our variables to visually inspect if a linear trend exists before fitting our regression model."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "plt.figure(figsize=(8, 5))\n",
    "plt.scatter(df['Study_Hours'], df['Exam_Score'], color='royalblue', alpha=0.7, label='Student Data')\n",
    "plt.title('Study Hours vs. Exam Scores')\n",
    "plt.xlabel('Hours Studied')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('Exam Score (%)')\n",
    "plt.grid(True, linestyle='--', alpha=0.6)\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  }
 ],
